  "notes": "Single source of truth for the bounded DSV4 PP8 resident production envelope. Materialized topology/runtime/KV JSON files must match this file. This profile is the first-three DSV4 parallelism step after live Qwen+Gemma+DSV4 startup and warm-cache COMPSEC runs showed stable steady-state RAM headroom. It keeps DSV4 at 16 active sequences and 8192 batched tokens while fixing DSV4 JIT KV prefetch exposure and rebalancing layers to 4/5/5/5/6/6/7/5 so spark4/spark5/spark6 absorb headroom and spark0 keeps API margin. It preserves 1GiB resident/offload KV per rank, 0.18 GPU utilization, SM121 DeepGEMM warmup skip, indexed sparse MLA prefill, IPv4 socket DSV4 PP sampled-token NCCL broadcasts over ds4ring0, and the DSV4-only warmup requirement before all-three residency."
